          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "git-alignment-unblock",
          "text": "v1.6.3 contract 补双字段（`truth_canonical: main` / `runtime_mirror: beacon/v1.6.3`）后，`doctor verify-git-alignment` / `doctor verify-delivery --version v1.6.3` 的 git-alignment 不再因 current_branch=main 报 `blocked=true`（reason_codes 清空或转为可解释的 non-blocked 状态）。本 AC 验证对象限定 v1.6.3 单版本（**Must**，UD-003）",
          "required": true,
          "status": "draft",
